      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PERFECT FORCE (5) progressive filly resuming. Scored a dominant win at her third race start over this track and trip last February. Looks ready to go after the slick trial win over 800m at Gosford. Well drawn with the claim and will take holding out. YES TO INFINITY (6) was heavily supported on debut ($1.65 fav), when he led throughout for a comfortable victory over 1000m at this track. Sticky gate today but has the upside to win again. DIVINE TIMING (8) showed a ton of ability in her first campaign and returned with a fast finishing Maiden win over 1100m at Goulburn. Gets a better run today and has genuine winning claims. BACKHANDER (10) is back after a break of nine months after going out a winner when saluting in a small field over 1200m at Tamworth last November. Fitted with the two trials and must be kept safe.",
